port filesystems/zrepl-dsh2dsh
type port
reason "DragonFly: add a DragonFly clockNanosleep to zrepl's nanosleep package (dragonfly/@<line> patch)"

# dragonfly/@<line>/patch-internal_daemon_nanosleep_dragonfly.go: zrepl's
# nanosleep package has clockNanosleep for Linux and FreeBSD only. The new
# file calls clock_nanosleep(2) (syscall 241, not in x/sys/unix for DragonFly)
# and takes the error from the return value, where DragonFly's kernel puts it.
